[
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily",
    "id": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily",
    "text": "步步高升"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily-example-1",
    "id": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily-example-1",
    "text": "多謝你嘅指導，希望你事業能夠步步高升。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily-example-2",
    "id": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily-example-2",
    "text": "新年快樂！祝你步步高升，健康快樂。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily-example-3",
    "id": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily-example-3",
    "text": "學生們努力讀書，希望成績可以步步高升。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily-example-4",
    "id": "bou6bou6gou1sing1-rise-steadily-example-4",
    "text": "如果你希望自己嘅生意做得更好，就要努力，步步高升。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical",
    "id": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical",
    "text": "半信半疑"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical-example-1",
    "id": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical-example-1",
    "text": "我聽你講嗰個故事，好似半信半疑咁。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical-example-2",
    "id": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical-example-2",
    "text": "佢講嘅話我半信半疑，唔太肯定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical-example-3",
    "id": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical-example-3",
    "text": "呢啲消息我半信半疑，想再等多啲證據。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical-example-4",
    "id": "bun3seon3bun3ji4-skeptical-example-4",
    "text": "當佢解釋完，我仲係半信半疑，未完全接受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted",
    "id": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted",
    "text": "前功盡廢"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted-example-1",
    "id": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted-example-1",
    "text": "我哋咁耐嘅準備都白費咗，真係前功盡廢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted-example-2",
    "id": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted-example-2",
    "text": "如果呢次唔成功，我之前嘅心機就前功盡廢喇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted-example-3",
    "id": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted-example-3",
    "text": "佢嘅錯誤決定，令到整個計劃都前功盡廢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted-example-4",
    "id": "cin4gung1zeon6fai3-effort-wasted-example-4",
    "text": "唔好咁快放棄，免得前功盡廢啦！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future",
    "text": "前途無量"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-1",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-1",
    "text": "你細個咁有才華，真係前途無量。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-2",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-2",
    "text": "呢間公司新政策推出後，前途無量。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-3",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-3",
    "text": "多謝你嘅幫助，令我睇到前途無量。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-4",
    "id": "cin4to4mou4loeng6-bright-future-example-4",
    "text": "只要堅持努力，前途無量無問題。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical",
    "id": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical",
    "text": "充之有理"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical-example-1",
    "id": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical-example-1",
    "text": "你嘅分析充之有理，我都同意佢嘅講法。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical-example-2",
    "id": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical-example-2",
    "text": "雖然佢講得好快，但其實充之有理。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical-example-3",
    "id": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical-example-3",
    "text": "呢個推論充之有理，但我哋仍需要更多證據支持。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical-example-4",
    "id": "cung1zi1jau5lei5-logical-example-4",
    "text": "根據你講嘅前提，充之有理我哋應該接受呢個方案。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted",
    "id": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted",
    "text": "全心一意"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted-example-1",
    "id": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted-example-1",
    "text": "我全心一意支持你嘅決定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted-example-2",
    "id": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted-example-2",
    "text": "佢全心一意為公司工作，冇半句怨言。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted-example-3",
    "id": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted-example-3",
    "text": "如果你想成功，就要全心一意投入。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted-example-4",
    "id": "cyun4sam1jat1ji3-wholehearted-example-4",
    "text": "我哋要全心一意照顧老人家，唔好分心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising",
    "id": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising",
    "text": "發展有為"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising-example-1",
    "id": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising-example-1",
    "text": "佢嘅事業真係發展有為，將來一定有好成績。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising-example-2",
    "id": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising-example-2",
    "text": "呢個計劃好新穎，發展有為，好值得投資。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising-example-3",
    "id": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising-example-3",
    "text": "小朋友喺音樂方面發展有為，將來有機會成為專業音樂家。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising-example-4",
    "id": "faat3zin2jau5wai4-promising-example-4",
    "text": "公司需要發展有為嘅年輕人，帶領團隊向前。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance",
    "id": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance",
    "text": "舉足輕重"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance-example-1",
    "id": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance-example-1",
    "text": "喺呢個公司度，佢嘅位舉足輕重，做咩決定都要睇佢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance-example-2",
    "id": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance-example-2",
    "text": "呢場會議裡面，財政部門嘅意見舉足輕重，所以大家都好注意。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance-example-3",
    "id": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance-example-3",
    "text": "疫情嘅控制對全球嚟講都係舉足輕重嘅因素。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance-example-4",
    "id": "geoi2zuk1hing1zung6-great-importance-example-4",
    "text": "呢位導演嘅決定對電影故事嘅發展舉足輕重。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed",
    "text": "見怪不怪"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-1",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-1",
    "text": "我啲朋友經歷咗好多怪事，依家見怪不怪喇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-2",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-2",
    "text": "做呢份工咁耐，見怪不怪，唔容易驚。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-3",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-3",
    "text": "呢啲事發生得多，佢都見怪不怪，表現好冷靜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-4",
    "id": "gin3gwaai3bat1gwaai3-unfazed-example-4",
    "text": "見怪不怪嘅態度幫我喺困難時保持冷靜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech",
    "text": "講不清楚"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-1",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-1",
    "text": "你講嘢講唔清楚，我聽唔明。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-2",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-2",
    "text": "佢成日講不清楚，令到人好困惑。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-3",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-3",
    "text": "做presentation嘅時候唔好講不清楚，要表達清晰。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-4",
    "id": "gong2bat1cing1co2-unclear-speech-example-4",
    "text": "你解釋條例嘅時候，唔好講不清楚，大家先知道點做。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing",
    "id": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing",
    "text": "氣勢磅礡"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing-example-1",
    "id": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing-example-1",
    "text": "嗰場音樂會嘅氣勢磅礡，令人難忘。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing-example-2",
    "id": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing-example-2",
    "text": "大自然嘅氣勢磅礡，令人敬畏。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing-example-3",
    "id": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing-example-3",
    "text": "電影入面戰爭場面氣勢磅礡，好震撼。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing-example-4",
    "id": "hei3sai3pong4bok6-grand-and-imposing-example-4",
    "text": "領袖嘅演講氣勢磅礡，激勵咗一大群人。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed",
    "id": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed",
    "text": "輕鬆自在"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed-example-1",
    "id": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed-example-1",
    "text": "周末我喺海邊散步，好輕鬆自在。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed-example-2",
    "id": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed-example-2",
    "text": "同埋朋友傾計，大家都好輕鬆自在。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed-example-3",
    "id": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed-example-3",
    "text": "呢間咖啡店嘅環境令我感覺輕鬆自在。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed-example-4",
    "id": "hing1sung1zi6zoi6-relaxed-example-4",
    "text": "完成工作之後，我可以輕鬆自在享受假期。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity",
    "id": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity",
    "text": "可遇不可求"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity-example-1",
    "id": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity-example-1",
    "text": "呢次嘅演唱會入場券真係可遇不可求，唔好錯過呀。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity-example-2",
    "id": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity-example-2",
    "text": "遇到呢啲好老友真係可遇不可求，要珍惜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity-example-3",
    "id": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity-example-3",
    "text": "發展咁好嘅機會可遇不可求，你要好好把握。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity-example-4",
    "id": "ho2jyu6bat1ho2kau4-rare-opportunity-example-4",
    "text": "呢啲機會唔容易嚟，真係可遇不可求。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start",
    "text": "開門紅利"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start-example-1",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start-example-1",
    "text": "今次開業真係有開門紅利，第一日就賺咗好多錢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start-example-2",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start-example-2",
    "text": "我哋期待新項目可以有開門紅利，順利進行落去。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start-example-3",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start-example-3",
    "text": "畀你知，好嘢開始咗有開門紅利，肯定會成功。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start-example-4",
    "id": "hoi1mun4hung4lei6-an-auspicious-start-example-4",
    "text": "今年嘅業績有開門紅利，希望繼續保持落去。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed",
    "id": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed",
    "text": "開心到飛起"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed-example-1",
    "id": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed-example-1",
    "text": "我考試考到好高分，開心到飛起！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed-example-2",
    "id": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed-example-2",
    "text": "聽到你嚟，我真係開心到飛起！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed-example-3",
    "id": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed-example-3",
    "text": "佢贏咗比賽，開心到飛起，成日笑住。 "
  },
  {
    "filename": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed-example-4",
    "id": "hoi1sam1dou3fei1hei2-overjoyed-example-4",
    "text": "收到你嘅禮物，我開心到飛起，多謝晒！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning",
    "id": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning",
    "text": "學以致用"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning-example-1",
    "id": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning-example-1",
    "text": "老師話學以致用先至可以真正掌握知識。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning-example-2",
    "id": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning-example-2",
    "text": "喺工作上學以致用好緊要，唔好淨係書本理論。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning-example-3",
    "id": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning-example-3",
    "text": "佢一直強調學以致用，唔係淨係睇書。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning-example-4",
    "id": "hok6ji5zi3jung6-apply-learning-example-4",
    "text": "學以致用，先可以喺人生路上更加順利。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful",
    "id": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful",
    "text": "學唔識福"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful-example-1",
    "id": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful-example-1",
    "text": "佢幫咗你咁多，你竟然學唔識福，真係好過份。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful-example-2",
    "id": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful-example-2",
    "text": "做人唔好學唔識福，要知感恩先得㗎。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful-example-3",
    "id": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful-example-3",
    "text": "嗰啲學唔識福嘅人，總係得寸進尺。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful-example-4",
    "id": "hok6m4zi1fuk1-ungrateful-example-4",
    "text": "你唔好咁學唔識福，啲人幫你嘅時候要記住。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain",
    "id": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain",
    "text": "因小失大"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain-example-1",
    "id": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain-example-1",
    "text": "你咁樣做可能會因小失大，唔值得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain-example-2",
    "id": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain-example-2",
    "text": "投資股市要小心，唔好因小失大。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain-example-3",
    "id": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain-example-3",
    "text": "你唔好為咗啲小利益因小失大，應該諗遠啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain-example-4",
    "id": "jan1siu2sat1daai6-suffer-big-loss-over-small-gain-example-4",
    "text": "老闆因為想慳幾蚊，結果因小失大，損失嚴重。"
  },
  {
