    "id": "jan4coi4zai3zai3-full-of-talent-example-2",
    "text": "個部門人才濟濟，競爭非常激烈。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan4coi4zai3zai3-full-of-talent-example-3",
    "id": "jan4coi4zai3zai3-full-of-talent-example-3",
    "text": "呢個城市人才濟濟，藝術文化好繁榮。"
