    "id": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd",
    "text": "人山人海"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd-example-1",
    "id": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd-example-1",
    "text": "今日地鐵站入面人人都係人山人海。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd-example-2",
    "id": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd-example-2",
    "text": "節日市集人山人海，好難行入去。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd-example-3",
    "id": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd-example-3",
    "text": "運動會現場簡直係人山人海，好熱鬧。"
  },
