    "filename": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd-example-4",
    "id": "jan4saan1jan4hoi2-huge-crowd-example-4",
    "text": "佢哋喺演唱會入面見到人山人海，覺得好興奮。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1baai6tou4dei6-total-defeat",
    "id": "jat1baai6tou4dei6-total-defeat",
    "text": "一敗塗地"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1baai6tou4dei6-total-defeat-example-1",
    "id": "jat1baai6tou4dei6-total-defeat-example-1",
    "text": "我哋公司喺今次市場競爭中一敗塗地。"
  },
