    "filename": "jat1baai6tou4dei6-total-defeat-example-3",
    "id": "jat1baai6tou4dei6-total-defeat-example-3",
    "text": "如果唔改進策略，下一次都可能一敗塗地。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1baai6tou4dei6-total-defeat-example-4",
    "id": "jat1baai6tou4dei6-total-defeat-example-4",
    "text": "這次討論中，我方的論點被完全反駁，真係一敗塗地。"
  },
  {
