    "id": "jat1bou6dang1tin1-overnight-success-example-2",
    "text": "唔係每個人都可以一步登天，要努力先得。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "jat1bou6dang1tin1-overnight-success-example-3",
    "id": "jat1bou6dang1tin1-overnight-success-example-3",
    "text": "呢間新公司一步登天，用咗幾個月就賺咗好多錢。"
