    "filename": "jat1gin3jyu4gu1-love-at-first-sight-example-3",
    "id": "jat1gin3jyu4gu1-love-at-first-sight-example-3",
    "text": "遇到一見如故嘅人係好幸運，代表緣份特別厚。"
