    "filename": "jat1min6zi1ci4-one-sided-example-1",
    "id": "jat1min6zi1ci4-one-sided-example-1",
    "text": "你聽咗佢講嘅嘢，都唔好淨係信，因為嗰啲只係一面之詞。"
