    "filename": "mei6jyu5cau4mau4-prepare-ahead-example-2",
    "id": "mei6jyu5cau4mau4-prepare-ahead-example-2",
    "text": "老闆話要未雨綢繆，啱啱開始諗計劃，唔好等到事後先做。"
  },
