  {
    "filename": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-deeply-heartbroken-example-3",
    "id": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-deeply-heartbroken-example-3",
    "text": "佢見到啲老朋友走咗，心如刀割，淚水不停流。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-deeply-heartbroken-example-4",
    "id": "sam1jyu4dou1got3-deeply-heartbroken-example-4",
    "text": "戰爭嘅傷害令國家嘅人民心如刀割。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind",
    "text": "心中有數"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-1",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-1",
    "text": "你唔使擔心，我對呢個計劃心中有數。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-2",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-2",
    "text": "雖然事情複雜，但我心中有數，唔會亂嚟。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-3",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-3",
    "text": "佢講得咁自信，肯定心中有數。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-4",
    "id": "sam1zung1jau5so2-something-in-mind-example-4",
    "text": "做老細嘅要心中有數，先可以帶領團隊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned",
    "id": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned",
    "text": "辛苦得來"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned-example-1",
    "id": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned-example-1",
    "text": "呢份工係我辛苦得來嘅機會，我一定會珍惜。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned-example-2",
    "id": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned-example-2",
    "text": "你嘅成績係辛苦得來嘅，唔好輕易放棄。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned-example-3",
    "id": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned-example-3",
    "text": "呢啲錢係我辛苦得來，唔可以亂用。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned-example-4",
    "id": "san1fu2dak1loi4-hard-earned-example-4",
    "text": "你要知道成功唔係易得，係辛苦得來先有價值。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless",
    "id": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless",
    "text": "生生不息"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless-example-1",
    "id": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless-example-1",
    "text": "生命嘅力量係生生不息，永遠唔會停。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless-example-2",
    "id": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless-example-2",
    "text": "遊戲入面嘅故事不停發展，真係生生不息。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless-example-3",
    "id": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless-example-3",
    "text": "部落嘅傳統文化係生生不息，代代相傳。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless-example-4",
    "id": "sang1sang1bat1sik1-endless-example-4",
    "text": "我哋嘅努力要有生生不息嘅精神，唔可以放棄。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome",
    "text": "水到渠成"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome-example-1",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome-example-1",
    "text": "你只要繼續努力，水到渠成，成功係遲早嘅事。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome-example-2",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome-example-2",
    "text": "呢個計劃準備得非常好，水到渠成肯定成功。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome-example-3",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome-example-3",
    "text": "我哋唔使擔心，長遠嚟講，水到渠成會發生。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome-example-4",
    "id": "seoi2dou3keoi4sing4-natural-outcome-example-4",
    "text": "只要團隊協作得好，水到渠成，計劃就順利完成。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight",
    "text": "水洩不通"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-1",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-1",
    "text": "地鐵喺早高峰時水洩不通，行路都要好小心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-2",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-2",
    "text": "音樂會入面水洩不通，連動彈嘅空間都冇。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-3",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-3",
    "text": "嗰條村嘅街市水洩不通，攤檔擺得好密。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-4",
    "id": "seoi2sit3bat1tung1-packed-tight-example-4",
    "text": "比賽現場水洩不通，觀眾擠到冇位坐。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change",
    "text": "時過境遷"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-1",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-1",
    "text": "我哋以前係好朋友，但係時過境遷，大家都走咗唔同嘅路。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-2",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-2",
    "text": "呢度嘅環境好多變，真係時過境遷。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-3",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-3",
    "text": "唔使再掛念舊日嘅風光，時過境遷，一切都唔同咗。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-4",
    "id": "si4gwo3ging2cin1-times-change-example-4",
    "text": "雖然我哋分開咗，但係時過境遷，希望大家都好。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient",
    "id": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient",
    "text": "事半功倍"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient-example-1",
    "id": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient-example-1",
    "text": "如果你用啱方法，真係可以做到事半功倍嘅效果。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient-example-2",
    "id": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient-example-2",
    "text": "依家我哋嘅團隊合作好，做嘢事半功倍。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient-example-3",
    "id": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient-example-3",
    "text": "學習新技巧能令你事半功倍，快啲達到目標。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient-example-4",
    "id": "si6bun3gung1pui5-efficient-example-4",
    "text": "改善工作流程可以令你事半功倍，工作更輕鬆。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other",
    "id": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other",
    "text": "相濡以沫"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other-example-1",
    "id": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other-example-1",
    "text": "喺呢個困難時期，我哋要相濡以沫，一齊撐落去。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other-example-2",
    "id": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other-example-2",
    "text": "佢哋夫妻兩個經常相濡以沫，感情好穩固。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other-example-3",
    "id": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other-example-3",
    "text": "團隊成員要相濡以沫，先至可以完成大目標。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other-example-4",
    "id": "soeng1jyu4ji5mut6-support-each-other-example-4",
    "text": "喺逆境入面，真正嘅朋友會相濡以沫，唔會放棄。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both",
    "id": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both",
    "text": "雙輸局面"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both-example-1",
    "id": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both-example-1",
    "text": "如果我哋唔溝通，結果只會係雙輸局面。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both-example-2",
    "id": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both-example-2",
    "text": "佢哋嘅爭拗最後演變成雙輸局面，大家都無得着數。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both-example-3",
    "id": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both-example-3",
    "text": "避免雙輸局面嘅最好方法係尋求合作同理解。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both-example-4",
    "id": "soeng1syu1guk6min6-lose-both-example-4",
    "text": "當兩邊都唔肯退讓，結果只會係雙輸局面。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet",
    "id": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet",
    "text": "尚未可知"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet-example-1",
    "id": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet-example-1",
    "text": "今次考試嘅結果尚未可知，大家都緊張緊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet-example-2",
    "id": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet-example-2",
    "text": "下星期嘅天氣尚未可知，要記得帶傘。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet-example-3",
    "id": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet-example-3",
    "text": "公司嘅重組計劃尚未可知，員工要保持耐心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet-example-4",
    "id": "soeng6mei6ho2zi1-unknown-yet-example-4",
    "text": "佢哋嘅決定尚未可知，我哋要繼續等消息。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice",
    "text": "上上之選"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice-example-1",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice-example-1",
    "text": "如果你想買手錶，呢隻真係上上之選。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice-example-2",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice-example-2",
    "text": "呢間餐廳嘅環境同服務都係上上之選。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice-example-3",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice-example-3",
    "text": "選呢份工作係我嘅上上之選，因為發展機會多。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice-example-4",
    "id": "soeng6soeng6zi1syun2-best-possible-choice-example-4",
    "text": "為公司挑員工，佢係上上之選。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless",
    "text": "天衣無縫"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-1",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-1",
    "text": "佢嘅報告寫得真係天衣無縫，冇得挑剔。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-2",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-2",
    "text": "呢場音樂會嘅安排可以話係天衣無縫，好精彩！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-3",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋嘅辯論策略真係天衣無縫，對手冇得鬥！"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-4",
    "id": "tin1ji1mou4fung6-flawless-example-4",
    "text": "畫家嘅作品每幅都天衣無縫，展現出高超嘅技術。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated",
    "id": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated",
    "text": "天注定"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated-example-1",
    "id": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated-example-1",
    "text": "我哋嘅相遇真係天注定，無得改變。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated-example-2",
    "id": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated-example-2",
    "text": "唔好擔心喇，有啲嘢真係天注定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated-example-3",
    "id": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated-example-3",
    "text": "佢哋分手咗，可能真係天注定。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated-example-4",
    "id": "tin1zyu3ding6-fated-example-4",
    "text": "我覺得依家嘅生活就係天注定嘅結果。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky",
    "id": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky",
    "text": "挑三揀四"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky-example-1",
    "id": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky-example-1",
    "text": "佢成日喺工作上挑三揀四，老細都唔鍾意。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky-example-2",
    "id": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky-example-2",
    "text": "食飯時唔好挑三揀四，試吓新嘢先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky-example-3",
    "id": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky-example-3",
    "text": "佢揀對象好挑三揀四，搵唔到合適嘅人。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky-example-4",
    "id": "tiu1saam1gaan2sei3-picky-example-4",
    "text": "做朋友唔好咁挑三揀四，要包容啲。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive",
    "id": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive",
    "text": "斬釘截鐵"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive-example-1",
    "id": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive-example-1",
    "text": "佢對呢個計劃嘅支持係斬釘截鐵，冇半句含糊。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive-example-2",
    "id": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive-example-2",
    "text": "老細斬釘截鐵話公司唔會裁員，令大家放心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive-example-3",
    "id": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive-example-3",
    "text": "喺個面試入面，你要表現得斬釘截鐵，好似有信心咁。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive-example-4",
    "id": "zaam2ding1zit6tit3-decisive-example-4",
    "text": "要贏呢場比賽，教練嘅指示一定要斬釘截鐵。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous",
    "text": "自以為是"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-1",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-1",
    "text": "佢成日自以為是，唔聽人講嘢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-2",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-2",
    "text": "唔好自以為是，試下接受唔同意見先。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-3",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-3",
    "text": "佢太自以為是，導致團隊冇法合作。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-4",
    "id": "zi6ji5wai4si6-self-righteous-example-4",
    "text": "自以為是嘅態度會令人氣餒。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory",
    "id": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory",
    "text": "自相矛盾"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory-example-1",
    "id": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory-example-1",
    "text": "佢講嘢完全係自相矛盾，唔知究竟係點。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory-example-2",
    "id": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory-example-2",
    "text": "你呢個理由聽落有啲自相矛盾，應該重新諗下。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory-example-3",
    "id": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory-example-3",
    "text": "政治嘅言論有時會自相矛盾，令人好困惑。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory-example-4",
    "id": "zi6soeng1mau4teon5-self-contradictory-example-4",
    "text": "佢先話唔去，之後又話想去，真係自相矛盾。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted",
    "text": "自作自受"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-1",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-1",
    "text": "佢唔聽勸告，結果自作自受，損失咗好多錢。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-2",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-2",
    "text": "你咁樣做，最終自作自受，唔好怪人。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-3",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-3",
    "text": "佢唔小心透露秘密，依家淨係自作自受。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-4",
    "id": "zi6zok3zi6sau6-self-inflicted-example-4",
    "text": "自作自受嘅教訓，希望你記住唔好再犯。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow",
    "id": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow",
    "text": "種瓜得瓜"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow-example-1",
    "id": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow-example-1",
    "text": "你努力學習，種瓜得瓜，成功一定係你嘅。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow-example-2",
    "id": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow-example-2",
    "text": "佢對人唔好，最終種瓜得瓜，都受咗報應。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow-example-3",
    "id": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow-example-3",
    "text": "投資有風險，種瓜得瓜，唔好一味貪心。"
  },
  {
    "filename": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow-example-4",
    "id": "zung3gwaa1dak1gwaa1-reap-what-you-sow-example-4",
    "text": "做乜嘢都有因果，種瓜得瓜，睇你點做嘞。"
  }
]